-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Configurations
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- LAN_GATEWAY is the customer's own router, which the LAN validator requires to be a different
-- address from the device's own LAN interface - so these are seeded at the last usable address of
-- each subnet, which is where the validator expects to find it.
--
-- Two shapes appear here. A config with ASSET_ID set belongs to a device that exists. A config with
-- ORDER_ID set and ASSET_ID null is what the ordering flow writes at step 4, before any asset
-- exists to attach it to.
